 },
 "readings_declared_before_results": {
  "cost_rule_level": "each cost rule is computed once per arm over the arm's means across the deciding entries, which is what `blindness_per_overclaim_removed` says; the same quantities per entry are reported as secondary tables.",
  "deciding_set": {
   "basis": "the freeze's named `entries.resolvable`: the entries a permitted leaf can enclose, which is where a rule about the scale of certification can act. `thin_reach` is excluded because the freeze says its uncertainty is charged to the depth cap and never counted as over-claim removed; the control is excluded because every one of its rows is not_applicable.",
   "sensitivity_over": [
    "granular/quiet_band",
    "granular/mixed_cell",
    "granular/thin_reach",
    "granular/semantic_step",
    "granular/tolerance_stack"
   ],
   "set": [
    "granular/quiet_band",
    "granular/mixed_cell",
    "granular/semantic_step",
    "granular/tolerance_stack"
   ]
  },
  "partition_equality": "hypothesis test 9 is evaluated on paired rows that share a partition. Where the run archived the campaign \u2014 the largest budget at the first seed, one per entry \u2014 the two atlases are compared cell by cell with the label excluded, which is the strong reading. Every other paired row enters on the weaker recorded test that its `leaf_cells` agree."
 },
 "recorded_defects": [
  "outcome 10's mechanism test is not computable from any recorded column. The freeze states that it is, and evaluates it 'whatever fires above'; a row carries certified volume inside the region and a count of evaluations per leaf, and nothing that ties a leaf's evaluations to a position inside the declared region. It is reported as unevaluated with the closest proxy named as a proxy. The next pre-registration that wants this test has to record the link.",
  "outcome 9's condition cannot distinguish a rename from a difference. It fires when the withheld volume holds no more declared region per unit than the unmeasured volume does, so it fires for 'equal' and for 'two orders of magnitude less' alike. On this corpus the two quantities are 0.0027 and 0.34 \u2014 a factor of 125 apart \u2014 and the rule as frozen reads that as PROVISIONAL being a name for a state the corpus already had. Both readings are published here; the decision does not rest on either.",
  "the freeze never lists the deciding set. Rules 1, 2, 4, 6 and 7 turn on 'the deciding set' and no section enumerates it. This analysis reads it as `entries.resolvable`, declares that reading before the results are printed, and reports the same figures over `entries.run` minus the control so the choice is visible rather than load-bearing.",
  "outcome 10 aside, the deciding signal is one entry deep. `certified_over_region_share` is zero under every arm on `granular/semantic_step`, on `granular/tolerance_stack` and on 15 of `granular/quiet_band`'s 20 rows, so the comparison that E1.5 exists to make is carried by five rows at the smallest budget on one entry. The freeze's own pre-run measurement said this before any arm ran; the run confirms it."
 ],
